{
  "brief_rationale": "The doctor systematically established the ICU/unconscious context (RC1), provided comprehensive red flags (RC2), managed pending results without fabricating (RC3), enforced NPO and medication safety (RC4), and built an executable family checklist (RC5). A minor omission exists in RC6: despite workplace evidence of deep venous access and line-care risks, the doctor never explicitly addressed procedural/line safety boundaries for the family. All other RCs are fully met, and no serious error is present, capping the trajectory at Grade 2 (Borderline). Several high-order points were partially or completely triggered but cannot elevate the grade above 2 due to the minor in-chain error.",
  "closure_assessment": {
    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00427",
        "explanation": "Doctor gives final bounded-closure summary carrying forward allowed residual uncertainty and ICU-team ownership.",
        "quote": "对，你现在的理解和安排都准确。下午沟通时按这四项问即可，并记下沟通时间和医生原话…拿到CT、脑电或用药结论后，把报告关键文字逐字发来，我帮你核对。"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode ends with an open, executable plan: family keeps the phone on, stays nearby, and will relay formal results when they appear. No premature reassurance or false closure was given.",
    "label": "valid_open",
    "safe": true,
    "traceable": true
  },
  "dimension_citations": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
        "explanation": "Initial response lays out family actions: confirm seizure status, daily questions, medication list, strict NPO, and history gathering.",
        "quote": "家属现在重点做这几件事：\n\n1. **向主管医生确认当前是否仍在抽搐**"
      }
    ],
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00063",
        "explanation": "Doctor structures targeted questions about consciousness, EEG, CT, medications, and pending results.",
        "quote": "1. **老人现在没醒，医生判断最可能是镇静药效、抽搐后的昏睡，还是脑部/代谢问题？意识与昨天相比有没有改善？**"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00360",
        "explanation": "Doctor recalls and integrates new family report about cardiac consultation and pending coagulation.",
        "quote": "患者房颤心律，现血肌钙蛋白提示高，心电图已完善，请贵科会诊"
      }
    ],
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00314",
        "explanation": "Doctor warns that coma with unverified CT and EEG findings does not mean safety and lists escalation triggers.",
        "quote": "如果一直叫不醒或意识恶化，可直接问医生目前最担心的原因是什么"
      }
    ],
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
        "explanation": "Advises family to designate one person to track five items daily to avoid confusion.",
        "quote": "家属可以指定一人每天记录“意识、呼吸支持、是否再抽、检查结果、用药变化”这五项，避免多人转述造成混乱。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "dimension_ratings": {
    "actionability_responsibility_chain": "good",
    "clinical_reasoning_direction": "good",
    "continuity_memory_focus": "good",
    "medical_safety_risk_recognition": "good",
    "patient_family_realworld_adaptation": "good"
  },
  "high_order_assessment": [
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00360",
          "explanation": "When family reports new hearing about cardiac consultation, doctor explicitly reprioritizes to include this in the plan.",
          "quote": "心血管内科会诊记录 申请理由:患者房颤心律，现血肌钙蛋白提示高"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00360",
          "explanation": "Doctor advises to ask about the cardiac consultation findings and timing.",
          "quote": "会诊记录（记录会诊意见执行情况）"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor did reprioritize when new information (cardiac consultation, pending coagulation) surfaced, but the reprioritization was not as forceful as the HO1 description demands; it was integrated as an additional item rather than a clear 'highest-risk current issue' restructuring. However, it did actively adapt the plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO1",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
