          "quote": "床旁也没听说又一直明显抽，防抽的药、镇静、呼吸血压那些支持还在边看边调"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00382",
          "explanation": "Doctor asks about underlying risk despite the family's partial reassurance.",
          "quote": "老人还是昏迷危重，继续禁食禁水"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor did challenge the family's potentially false-reassuring statement ('no more convulsions' while still unconscious) and asked about EEG/CT, but did not perform a full structured verification of the ambiguous data before changing risk level as described in HO2 criteria.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00427",
          "explanation": "Doctor closes only the current bounded task, carries forward allowed residual uncertainty, and identifies owner and timing for each residual category.",
          "quote": "拿到CT、脑电或用药结论后，把报告关键文字逐字发来，我帮你核对"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00427",
          "explanation": "Doctor repeats emergency thresholds that override waiting for scheduled updates.",
          "quote": "若医生提出需要立即决定的抢救、手术或生命支持，先问清“发生了什么、建议做什么、不做的直接风险”"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "The final turn explicitly states what has been safely organized for today, names unresolved items (pending CT, EEG, medication lists), identifies owner and timing (ICU team, next communication), and repeats emergency thresholds. This satisfies all HO3 completion criteria.",
      "ho_id": "HO3",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    },
    {
      "active_model_action": true,
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor provides a concrete written tracking structure: designate one person to record five items daily.",
          "quote": "家属可以指定一人每天记录“意识、呼吸支持、是否再抽、检查结果、用药变化”这五项，避免多人转述造成混乱。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00314",
          "explanation": "Doctor assigns a feasible family process for recording questions, results, and next review time.",
          "quote": "若方便，把医生告知的检查结果、当前用药单或病情说明拍照上传，我可以再帮你们逐项梳理。"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "partial",
      "explanation": "The doctor provided a practical coordination method (one spokesperson, written question list, time-stamped notes) but did not fully address the real-world friction of caregiver fatigue/conflict and limited ICU access as described in HO4 criteria. The plan was partially adapted.",
      "ho_id": "HO4",
      "meaningful_trajectory_impact": true,
      "triggered": true
    }
  ],
