          "quote": "不要喂水、饭或口服药，以免误吸窒息"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor obtained family receipt and teach-back of the practical plan, confirmed understanding of red flags and NPO, and addressed remaining confusion before closure. This fully meets RC8.",
